      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "POSTER COMMAND (5) is a son of Poster Boy on debut for Josh Turnbuill. Has looked good in winning each of his five trials so could kick off his career on a winning note. FLINCENT (9) started the campaign with back-to-back placings before digging deep last start to score by a nose at this circuit and distance. Shouldn't spend a penny from this draw and the sprint lane may come in handy. Could go through his grades now. SWINGING QUEEN (7) resumes from a spell of three-and-a-half months after closing off last campaign with a win in the rich APG 2F Final at Menangle. Readied with a couple of city trials and could go well on her return. SOPHIES WISH (10) ended last preparation with back-to-back city placings, getting within a nose of SWINGING QUEEN in the APG Final when last seen. Readied with a couple of trials and won over this distance the only time she raced here. First starter HARD MERCHANDISE (2) has been winning at the trials so must be kept safe.",
